    "title": "What channel is UConn vs Michigan game tonight? When is NCAA championship game? Start time, scores",
    "text": "Updated April 6, 2026, 6:32 p.m. ETThe Michigan Wolverines will play the UConn Huskies in the 2026 NCAA men's basketball championship game.The game is scheduled for Monday, April 6, 2026, at 8:50 p.m. ET in Indianapolis.Viewers can watch the championship matchup on TBS or stream it on SlingTV.Both teams have key players, Michigan's Yaxel Lendeborg and UConn's Solo Ball, who are expected to play despite recent injuries.The Michigan Wolverines play the UConn Huskies in the championship game of the NCAA men's basketball tournament in March Madness action tonight on TBS.Here's what you need to know tonight's matchup, how to watch, the 2026 March Madness bracket, odds and more:What channel is the UConn Huskies vs Michigan Wolverines game on TV tonight, Monday, April 6? How to watch Michigan-Connecticut March Madness 2026 NCAA championship game today liveThe Michigan Wolverines and Connecticut Huskies game will air on TBS tonight, Monday, April 6, 2026.Watch NCAA tournament action on SlingWhat time does Michigan Wolverines vs UConn Huskies NCAA championship game final start today, Monday, April 6? When is Connecticut-Michigan March Madness 2026 NCAA championship final game tonight live?The Michigan Wolverines and Connecticut Huskies play on TBS at 8:50 p.m. ET Monday, April 6, 2026, in Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis.Watch NCAA tournament action on SlingHow to stream UConn-Michigan 2026 NCAA championship game today, Monday, April 6. Where to watch Michigan-Connecticut March Madness 2026 NCAA championship game final tonight liveThe Michigan Wolverines and Connecticut Huskies will stream on SlingTV at 8:50 p.m. ET, Monday, April 6, 2026. Fans can download SlingTV in the Apple App Store or on Google Play.Watch NCAA tournament action on Sling2025-2026 UConn Huskies season record, Big East conference recordUConn Huskies: (34-5, 17-3 Big East)UConn basketball 2026 NCAA tournament results: How Huskies reached national championship in March Madness bracketFirst round: UConn 82, Furman 71Second round: UConn 73, UCLA 57Sweet 16: UConn 67, Michigan State 63Elite 8: UConn 73, Duke 72Final 4: UConn 71, Illinois 622025-2026 Michigan Wolverines season record, Big Ten conference recordMichigan Wolverines: (36-3, 19-1 Big Ten)Michigan basketball 2026 NCAA tournament results: How Wolverines reached NCAA Final Four in March Madness bracketFirst round: Michigan 101, Howard 80Second round: Michigan 95, Saint Louis 72Sweet 16: Michigan 90, Alabama 77Elite 8: Michigan 95, Tennessee 62Final 4: Michigan 91, Arizona 72March Madness 2026 NCAA championship game odds for men's basketball betting: BetMGMVisit www.in.betmgm.com for the latest odds of every NCAA tournament men's basketball game.UConn Huskies men's basketball roster 2026: NCAA Final Four March Madness at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis0, Malachi Smith1, Solo Ball2, Silas Demary Jr.3, Jaylin Stewart4, Dwayne Koroma5, Tarris Reed Jr.7, Jacob Furphy9, Alec Millender10, Rrezon Elezaj11, Alex Karaban12, Eric Reibe13, Jacob Ross23, Jayden Ross24, Braylon Mullins77, Uros PaunovicWho are UConn's best players?Tarris Reed Jr. averages 14.7 points and 8.8 rebounds per game.Alex Karaban averages 13.2 points and 5.2 rebounds, making 38.6% of his 3-pointers.Solo Ball averages 12.9 points.Braylon Mullins averages 11.9 points.Silas Demary Jr. averages 10.4 points, 5.9 assists, 4.5 rebounds and 1.6 steals, with 40.5% 3-point shooting.2025-26 UConn Huskies basketball team statsThe Huskies share the ball, averaging 18.4 assists per game (No. 7 nationally).Opponents make just 21.8 shots from the field per game (No. 4), and 5.9 3-pointers (No. 13).Will Solo Ball play tonight in the national championship game?Solo Ball, UConn's third-leading scorer, suffered a foot sprain in the Huskies' win over Illinois in the national semifinals and was in a walking boot Sunday. He said he plans on playing.UConn coach Dan Hurley is looking for his third NCAA basketball championship in four yearsDan Hurley is the always-animated eighth-year coach who guided the Huskies to national championships in 2023 and '24. He previously coached two years at Wagner and six at Rhode Island. His brother, Bobby Hurley, was the previous NCAA career assists record-holder before Purdue's Braden Smith surpassed him this year. Bobby Hurley has coached Buffalo and Arizona State.Michigan Wolverines men's basketball roster 2026: NCAA Final Four March Madness at Lucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis0, Ricky Liburd1, Trey McKenney2, L.J. Cason3, Elliot Cadeau4, Nimari Burnett5, Oscar Goodman7, Howard Eisley Jr.10, Winters Grady11, Roddy Gayle Jr.12, Charlie May13, Harrison Hockberg15, Aday Mara21, Morez Johnson Jr.23, Yaxel Lendeborg32, Malick Kordel42, Will TschetterWho are Michigan's best players?Yaxel Lendeborg averages 15.1 points, 6.9 rebounds and shoots 38.3% from 3-point range.Morez Johnson Jr. averages 13.1 points and 7.3 rebounds.Aday Mara averages 12.2 points, 6.8 rebounds and 2.6 blocked shots.Elliot Cadeau averages 10.3 points and 5.9 assists, making 37.9% of his 3s.Trey McKenney averages 9.9 points, making 39.4% of his 3s.Will Yaxel Lendeborg play tonight in the national championship game?Michigan leading scorer Yaxel Lendeborg suffered injuries to his left knee and ankle in the first half of its win over Arizona in the national semifinals, though he returned to the game in the second half, scoring 11 points. He intends to play.2025-26 Michigan Wolverines basketball team statsMichigan averages 87.5 points and 18.8 assists per game (both No. 4 nationally). The Wolverines shoot 51.1% from the field (No. 3), and 61.2% on 2-pointers (No. 2).The Wolverines limit opponents to 38.6% shooting, the nation's best.Michigan corrals 27.4 defensive rebounds per game (No. 3) and hold a 9-rebound edge per game.Going inside against Michigan is fraught with danger. It's 6.1 blocked shots per game are No. 2 in the nation.Michigan basketball coach Dusty MayDusty May has Michigan in the Final Four in his second season. He coached Florida Atlantic for six seasons before joining Michigan, leading the Owls to the 2023 Final Four. May grew up in Greene County, Indiana, and was a student manager for Bob Knight's Indiana teams from 1996-2000.How did the March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament experts fare? Bracket picks, predictions for NCAA tournament men's basketballCompare your March Madness bracket to the USA Today experts. See every pick from 10 different brackets.Chris Sims is a trending reporter at Midwest Connect Gannett. Follow him on Twitter: @ChrisFSims.",
